# SF Headless CRM — Workflow Rules

All workflow rules are defined in: docs/WORKFLOW.md
This file exists for Cursor Agent mode only — Hermes follows the same rules via its
sf-headless-crm-workflow skill (loaded on the VM). Both reference docs/WORKFLOW.md as
the single source of truth.

Key points:
- No direct pushes to main; always use a feature branch + PR
- Do not implement @platform:cursor stories
- Do not close issues/mark cards done before PR merge + org deploy + sanity check
- Branch naming: feat/EPICxx-USxx-short-name
- See docs/WORKFLOW.md for full details: roles, state machine, deployment, handoff protocol
- See docs/environment.md for org/scratch org facts